*******************

With their unreplicable blend of blues, rock, soul and the pure joy of making music–Hootie & the Blowfish are unparalleled in their uniquely universal sound. The band fine tuned this sound playing frat parties and gigs at the University of South Carolina. The transition from playing covers to original songs was warmly received by audiences around the southeast and the band released their first full album “Cracked Rear View” in 1994 to legendary success. With hits like “Only Wanna Be With You”, “Hold My Hand” and “Let Her Cry” Cracked Rear View remains the 9th best selling album in music history. 

